  "players": "2-4 player story: local split screen (coop_split.gd) now, online next (players_spawned signal + meta player_id / peer_id)",
  "layout_direction": "Theory: principles from Legend of Zelda (far landmarks, triangle rule, hub per region, sky/surface/depths), GTA 5 (city districts joined by highways with traffic, skyline anchor), Kingdom Hearts (themed zones: entry plaza + save point + Squad Post, branches to set-piece arenas). Principles only, no places copied; each region lists its own under design.",
